class.description:
In the streaming assets mode [code]pack[/code] ([code]filesystem/streaming_assets/mode[/code]), [StreamingAssetsExportPlugin] uses this class at the end of a Windows or Linux/BSD export: it builds the folder [code]filesystem/streaming_assets/source_folder[/code] into a second pack, [code]filesystem/streaming_assets/pack_file[/code] (default [code]"{exe_name}.streaming.pck"[/code]), next to the main pack or the executable. At startup, [StreamingAssetsServer] mounts that pack, so the files load with their [code]res://[/code] and [code]uid://[/code] paths, and [code]streaming://[/code] points to the folder.
The folder goes through the export pipeline of the preset with [method PCKPackageExporter.export_description_with_preset]: imported resources (their [code].import[/code] files and imported artifacts for the platform), [code].remap[/code] files, converted scenes and resources, and tokenized scripts are packed like in the main pack, and the preset's encryption settings and key apply. Files outside the folder that the streaming files depend on are not packed: the main pack ships them. The UIDs of the streaming files stay in the main pack's UID cache, because the main export only skips the files.
[codeblocks]
[gdscript]
@tool
extends EditorScript

func _run():
	var description := StreamingAssetsPackBuilder.make_description("res://streaming_assets")
	print(description.get_file_paths())
	var preset := PCKPackageExporter.find_preset("Windows Desktop")
	var err := StreamingAssetsPackBuilder.build(preset, "res://streaming_assets", "C:/Builds/Game.streaming.pck")
	print(error_string(err))
[/gdscript]
[csharp]
using Godot;

[Tool]
public partial class BuildStreamingPack : EditorScript
{
	public override void _Run()
	{
		PckPackage description = StreamingAssetsPackBuilder.MakeDescription("res://streaming_assets");
		GD.Print(description.GetFilePaths());
		EditorExportPreset preset = PckPackageExporter.FindPreset("Windows Desktop");
		Error err = StreamingAssetsPackBuilder.Build(preset, "res://streaming_assets", "C:/Builds/Game.streaming.pck");
		GD.Print(err);
	}
}
[/csharp]
[/codeblocks]
[b]Note:[/b] This class is only available in editor builds and runs on the main thread. It cannot be instantiated: all methods are static.
